# logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Ralph loop state — sessions/ holds per-run progress.json, prompts, agent
# outputs, verification logs, and monitor verdicts. Loop commits go through
# git; the session directory is loop-internal scratch.
automation/sessions/

# Per-machine Claude Code permission state. Allowlist accumulates as the user
# approves bash commands during a session; that state is local to one machine
# and should not be tracked. .claude/settings.json (project-level) IS tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Per-machine Claude Code scheduler lock; runtime state, never project content.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# cc-sdd kiro-* skills and related artifacts are installed per-developer via
# automation/install.sh. They are tooling, not project content. The project's
# own intentgraph-* skills under .claude/skills/ and .codex/skills/ ARE tracked.
# cc-sdd v3.0.2 writes Codex skills to .agents/ at the repo root (drift from
# older versions); it also drops a spec-reviewer agent under .codex/agents/
# and a settings-templates tree under .kiro/.
.claude/skills/kiro-*
.agents/
.codex/agents/
.kiro/
